# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Windows sets core.autocrlf=true system-wide, which checks files out as CRLF.
# Prettier's endOfLine: 'lf' would then report every file as unformatted. This
# pins the checkout to LF so `format:check` agrees across machines and CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
